                <div class="bmc-card__body">
                    <p class="bmc-bodytext">
                        What happens to a player's motivation and morale when the club makes, keeps or breaks a promise, and while a contract role guarantee is in breach.
                    </p>

                    <span class="bmc-lbl bmc-lbl--ink" style="margin-top:10px">MOTIVATION</span>
                    <div class="bmc-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:10px">
